D44. The man with a hundred eyes. ~ ARGUS
D45. This is stubborn. ~ DOGGED
D48. This is the same as it was in Caesar's day. ~ IDEM
D50. A disturbance often caused by different wave lengths. ~ NAUSEA
D53. Cubic meters. ~ STERES
D56. This comes before the divorce. ~ TRIAL
